		"spell_zeripassive_tooltip": "Zeri's Attacks are treated as Abilities instead of Attacks and can be charged up by moving and casting <spellName>{{Spell_ZeriQ_Name}}</spellName>. Uncharged Attacks consume a small amount of charge, deal <magicDamage>@Spell.ZeriQ:MinDamage@ magic damage</magicDamage> and <danger>execute</danger> enemies below <attention>@Spell.ZeriQ:PassiveExecuteThreshold@ Health</attention>. A fully charged Attack deals <magicDamage>@Spell.ZeriQ:PassiveMaxDamage@ + @Spell.ZeriQ:PassiveMaxChargePercentHealth@ max Health magic damage</magicDamage> and consumes all charge."
	}
}